        "original_id": "9096b3ec-85c0-5625-9108-9aa59274aee8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Coyne, Robert Palmer\n- Roles: lead singer, backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, songwriter\n- Organizations: the Flaming Lips\n- Topics: musical styles, voice, fashion\n\nFacts:\n- Wayne Coyne is the lead singer, occasional backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, and songwriter for the Flaming Lips.\n- Robert Palmer was known for his distinctive, soulful voice.\n- Robert Palmer was known for an eclectic mix of musical styles on his albums, combining soul, jazz, rock, pop, reggae, and blues.\n- Robert Palmer was also known for sartorial acumen.",
